PURPOSE:
Step 0 of the pipeline. Accepts any input file format — CSV, JSON,
Excel, PDF, plain text, or unknown. Extracts repository usage signals.
Detects the source SCM platform. Identifies signals not yet in the
DB discovery_mapping table. Produces structured usage_signals for
